    "body": "It looks like this was discussed in https://github.com/w3c/DOM-Parsing/issues/24 . At the time we didn't think of using `document.domain`, I guess. /cc @annevk \n\nSince this is not observable otherwise, it feels cleaner to update browsers to follow the current spec, but, maybe it is not worth the trouble and we should just update the spec to follow browsers.",
